<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Valero said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Valero said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs raised its rating on Valero Energy Corp to outperform from market perform, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not imemdiately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rallied 2-1/4 to 27-1/4.</p>
